OL,3,GNEWSAMum found fatal crash scene while
OL,4,Alooking for sons
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother discovered the crash scene
OL,7,Fwhere her son was killed while out
OL,8,Flooking for him and his identical twin
OL,9,Fin the middle of the night, a court has
OL,10,Fheard.
OL,12,FThomas Plane and brother James were
OL,13,Ftravelling home on e-bikes after a
OL,14,Fnight out in Norwich when the pair fell
OL,15,Foff in Barrack Street shortly after
OL,16,F01:20 GMT on 24 December 2025.
OL,18,FDriver Nicolae Brica was distracted and
OL,19,Fstruck both brothers, killing Thomas
OL,20,FPlane, 28, and seriously injuring
OL,21,FJames.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
